{"scope":"rt-82303014ab","css":".rt-82303014ab p.MsoNormal, .rt-82303014ab li.MsoNormal, .rt-82303014ab div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; font-size:12.0pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;}\n.rt-82303014ab h1 {margin:0cm; text-align:center; page-break-after:avoid; font-size:16.0pt; font-family:\"Courier New\"; text-decoration:underline;}\n.rt-82303014ab div.WordSection1 {}","html":"<div class=WordSection1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:10.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251657728;left:-52px;\r\ntop:18px;width:994px;height:20px'><img width=795 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlh4gMCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAADiAwIAgAAAAAAAAAJGBHKJq83vIpyy0msz3rrz74XgKJbkaaboqrbs68bwLNf0bef4rvf87wsChwaiUYg8KpPMpbMJfUqj1Km1ir1qs9ytNwEoAAA7\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT OF\r\nRADIOLOGY &amp; IMAGING<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<h1><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>U\r\nS G REPORT OF LEFT \/ RIGHT BREAST<\/span><\/h1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Left \/ right\r\nbreast show normal fibroglandular pattern.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No focal lesion\r\nis seen in left \/ right breast.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Nipple &amp;\r\nareola complex appears normal.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No ductal\r\ndilatation is seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Skin thickness\r\nis within normal limits.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Retromammory\r\nspace \/ underlying pectoralis major muscle appears normal.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Axilla shows no\r\nobvious enlarged lymph nodes.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Axillary vessels\r\nare well visualized and are normal in appearance.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><u><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><u><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>IMPRESSION<\/span><\/u><\/b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> : <\/span><\/u><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Rest of the\r\nfindings are within normal limit. <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Suggested : Clinical correlation with further\r\nevaluation and follow up please.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Disclaimer :\r\nDiagnosis of fibroadenosis of breast is strictly clinical and is <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nnot based on any ultrasonographic findings. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>** Please\r\ncontact for any typographical error.\u00a0 <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Checked\r\nby\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nDR. MADHUSHREE RAY<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00